OL,3,GNEWSAWoman escapes with minor injuries
OL,4,Aas car hit by train
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was taken to hospital with
OL,7,Fminor injuries after a car was hit by a
OL,8,Ffreight train on a level crossing in
OL,9,FLeicestershire.
OL,11,FBritish Transport Police said it was
OL,12,Fcalled to the crossing in Rearsby at
OL,13,Fabout 20:35 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,15,FA spokesperson for the force said the
OL,16,Fwoman was the only person in the car,
OL,17,Fand she was taken to hospital to be
OL,18,Fassessed.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
