OL,3,GNEWSAWoman escapes with minor injuries
OL,4,Aas car hit by train
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe was assisted out of the car by
OL,7,Fmembers of the public before emergency
OL,8,Fservices arrived. Inquiries are ongoing
OL,9,Fto establish why the vehicle was on the
OL,10,Ftracks, the spokesperson added.
